{"ref":"BDB, מַחְשָׁךְ","hw":"מַחְשָׁךְ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְשָׁךְ</span></big>  <strong>n.m. dark place</strong> (poet.)—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.15\">Is 29:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.16\">42:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְשָׁ֑ךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:19\" href=\"/Psalms.88.19\">ψ 88:19</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲשַׁכִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:7\" href=\"/Psalms.88.7\">88:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 143:3\" href=\"/Psalms.143.3\">143:3</a> = <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:6\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.6\">La 3:6</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲשַׁכֵּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:20\" href=\"/Psalms.74.20\">ψ 74:20</a>;—<em>dark place:</em><br><strong>a.</strong>  = <em>hiding-place</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מח׳־ארץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:20\" href=\"/Psalms.74.20\">74:20</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  <em>dark region</em>, in which men may lose their way <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.16\">Is 42:16</a>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  = <em>grave</em>, or <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁאול</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:19\" href=\"/Psalms.88.19\">ψ 88:19</a> (v. Che); of dark place of God’s wrath (like Sheʾôl) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:7\" href=\"/Psalms.88.7\">88:7</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 143:3\" href=\"/Psalms.143.3\">143:3</a> = <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:6\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.6\">La 3:6</a>.<br><strong>d.</strong>  = <em>secret place, secrecy</em> (of plots) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.15\">Is 29:15</a>.","next":"BDB, חָשַׁל","prev":"BDB, חֲשֵׁכָה"}